<p class=3DMsoNormal><span class=3DSpellE>Eskender</span> <span class=3DSpe=
llE>Teklu</span>
<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal>Film Director, Scriptwriter and Producer<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style=3D'font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%'>Short Biography<o:p></o:p></spa=
n></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt=
:auto;
line-height:normal'><span style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New =
Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Hello, I am <span class=3DSpellE=
>Eskender</span>
<span class=3DSpellE>Teklu</span>, a passionate film director and scriptwri=
ter
dedicated to bringing powerful Ethiopian stories to life.<o:p></o:p></span>=
</p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt=
:auto;
line-height:normal'><span style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New =
Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>My journey in filmmaking began at
the Tom Videography and Photography Training Center, where I built a
comprehensive foundation in videography, photography, directing, scriptwrit=
ing,
and editing. Following my graduation, I stepped directly into feature filmm=
aking,
releasing my debut film, <span class=3DSpellE><i>Baletefa</i></span>, follo=
wed by
the drama series <i>Kale Be Kale</i> and the feature <span class=3DSpellE><=
i>Samera</i></span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt=
:auto;
line-height:normal'><span style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New =
Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>To deepen my artistic and techni=
cal
expertise, I pursued a Master's degree in Film Production at Addis Ababa
University, graduating in July 2025. This academic milestone expanded my
creative network within the film industry, enabling me to helm larger,
high-budget productions featuring legendary Ethiopian actors and actresses,
most notably the critically acclaimed feature <i>Key <span class=3DSpellE>M=
esemer</span></i>
(Red Line).<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt=
:auto;
line-height:normal'><span style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New =
Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Building upon this momentum, I
produced and directed the series <span class=3DSpellE><i>Guramyle</i></span=
>,
followed in July 2026 by writing, producing, and directing the compelling
feature <span class=3DSpellE><i>Tiketokerwa</i></span> (The <span class=3DS=
pellE>Tiktoker</span>).<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt=
:auto;
line-height:normal'><span style=3D'font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New =
Roman","serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Today, I am channeling this
extensive experience, craft, and creative vision toward the international
stage, actively working on global collaborations and projects that bridge l=
ocal
narratives with worldwide audiences.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

